    <td class="header">
    <h3>iRogue Game-Save Survey</h3>
<P> <i>This <a href="index.php">survey</a> is about the PalmOS game 
<a href="../iRogue/index.php">iRogue</a>,
part of the <a href="../index.php">Roguelikes for PalmOS</a> project
hosted at <a href="http://sourceforge.net">SourceForge</a>.</i>
    </td>
